{"seq":2,"slug":"bundle-price-allocation-component","title":"Bundle 价格与折扣在组件上的分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-price-allocation-component","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"bundle-价格与折扣在组件上的分摊\">Bundle 价格与折扣在组件上的分摊</h1><p>一个原价 300 的组合卖 249，优惠的 51 应该怎样落到组件 A、B、C 上？多数团队把这个当成展示问题——反正买家看到的是一个 249，组件分多少有什么关系。关系很大，因为<strong>分摊表就是退款基数和成本核算的底稿</strong>。买家只退 B 时退多少钱、跨境申报时每个组件报多少价值、财务确认收入时按什么金额拆分，全部从这张表取数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相对独立售价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = P \\cdot \\frac{s_i}{\\sum s_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2538em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>收入确认、退款基数</td>\n<td>需维护独立售价数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件原价占比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = P \\cdot \\frac{c_i}{\\sum c_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2538em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无独立售价时的近似</td>\n<td>与独立售价背离时口径不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等额分摊</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = P / n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>组件价值接近的同质组合</td>\n<td>高值件退款基数被低估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为组合实付金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为组件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的独立售价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其原标价。行业与会计口径上的推荐是第一种：IFRS 15 要求企业按<strong>相对独立售价</strong>把交易价格分摊到各项履约义务（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ifrs-15-revenue-from-contracts-with-customers/\">IFRS 15 Revenue from Contracts with Customers</a>）。跨境电商在做多组件收入确认或税务口径拆分时，跟随这一口径最省事。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么等额分摊会出事\">为什么等额分摊会出事</h3><p>假设组合是「笔记本（原价 8000）+ 鼠标（原价 100）」，实付 7500。等额分摊给笔记本 3750、鼠标 3750。买家单独退鼠标，按分摊基数要退 3750——远超鼠标的实际价值，这是纯粹的反薅漏洞。相对独立售价给出笔记本 7408、鼠标 92，符合直觉。<strong>组件价值差异越大，等额分摊越危险</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊的落地结构\">分摊的落地结构</h2><p>分摊结果必须在订单落库时就固化，不能留到退款时再算——因为那时的独立售价可能已经变了。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_line_allocation (&#10;  order_id      VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  line_id       VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  component_sku VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  qty           INT           NOT NULL,&#10;  list_price    DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,   -- 组件原标价&#10;  ref_price     DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,   -- 分摊基准（独立售价或原价）&#10;  allocated_amt DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,   -- 分摊后实付金额&#10;  refunded_amt  DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (order_id, line_id, component_sku)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_line_allocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  component_sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list_price    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组件原标价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ref_price     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分摊基准（独立售价或原价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocated_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分摊后实付金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  refunded_amt  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, line_id, component_sku)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保留 <code>ref_price</code> 而不只存 <code>allocated_amt</code> 是刻意的：当买家用部分退货触发「重新分摊」时，需要原始基准才能重算，否则只能按剩余金额比例粗糙处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"尾差必须显式处理\">尾差必须显式处理</h3><p>按比例分摊后各组件金额之和通常不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，差几分钱。这是一个必须显式指定归属的工程细节，而不是四舍五入掉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[组合实付 P] --&gt; B[按 ref_price 计算各组件理论分摊]&#10;  B --&gt; C[向下取整到最小货币单位]&#10;  C --&gt; D[计算残差 R = P - sum]&#10;  D --&gt; E{残差如何归属}&#10;  E --&gt;|规则A| F[归给金额最大的组件]&#10;  E --&gt;|规则B| G[按 ref_price 降序逐分发放]&#10;  E --&gt;|规则C| H[归给最后一个组件]&#10;  F --&gt; I[固化分摊表]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[组合实付 P] --&gt; B[按 ref_price 计算各组件理论分摊]\n  B --&gt; C[向下取整到最小货币单位]\n  C --&gt; D[计算残差 R = P - sum]\n  D --&gt; E{残差如何归属}\n  E --&gt;|规则A| F[归给金额最大的组件]\n  E --&gt;|规则B| G[按 ref_price 降序逐分发放]\n  E --&gt;|规则C| H[归给最后一个组件]\n  F --&gt; I[固化分摊表]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>推荐规则 B：按分摊基准降序，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个最小货币单位逐个分给前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个组件。它保证任何一次部分退货时，误差不会被系统性地堆在同一个组件上——这是规则 A 与 C 的共同缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二次分摊-部分退货后如何重算\">二次分摊：部分退货后如何重算</h2><p>买家退了组件 B，退款金额按 B 的 <code>allocated_amt</code> 退还，这没什么可争的。真正复杂的是<strong>组合的剩余部分</strong>：剩下 A 与 C 是否还构成原组合？如果构成，剩余组合的新实付金额就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>退给B的</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P - \\text{退给B的}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退给</span><span class=\"mord\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的</span></span></span></span></span></span>，理论上应当按剩余组件的基准重新分摊；如果不构成（比如 A 单卖没有意义），系统应当触发原组合的失效并标记剩余行。</p>\n<p>两种策略各有代价：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不重算</strong>：剩余组件的 <code>allocated_amt</code> 保持不变。简单，但剩余组合的「原价合计 vs 实付合计」的折扣率会偏离设计值，若后续再退 A 则退款基数偏高。</li>\n<li><strong>重算</strong>：按剩余组件的基准重新分摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>refunded</mtext><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P&#x27; = P - \\text{refunded}_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refunded</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。口径更一致，但需要处理「重算后金额小于已退金额」的不可能状态，且每次退货都要写一批分摊行。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实践中多数系统选「不重算 + 记录退货事件」，并在退款规则里对「连续部分退货」设置上限（退到累计金额等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为止）。这个上限是必要的安全阀：没有它，逐件退完的累计退款可能超过实付金额——这在按比例分摊 + 尾差处理不当时是会真实发生的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退货基数的边界\">退货基数的边界</h3><p>无论用哪种策略，有一条规则必须硬性成立：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>refunded</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{refunded}_i \\le P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refunded</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，即全组合的累计退款不得超过实付金额。这条不变量应当用数据库约束或事务内校验强制，而不是依赖业务代码的自觉。支付侧的能力也支持这一约束——Stripe 的退款接口允许对单次 PaymentIntent 发出多笔部分退款，但累计金额不能超过原始支付金额（见 <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/refunds\">Stripe Refunds</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与订单级促销的边界\">与订单级促销的边界</h2><p>本 hub 讲的分摊处理的是<strong>组合自身定价里已含的让利</strong>（整包价低于组件单买之和）。它和订单级优惠券是两笔独立的账，顺序是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>先按组合定价算出组合实付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，并完成组件分摊。</li>\n<li>再在订单级应用优惠券、满减、积分，其让利按订单行的 <code>allocated_amt</code> 比例继续向下分摊。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>顺序不可颠倒。若先算订单级优惠再算组合分摊，会出现「优惠券的让利混进了组合折扣」的账，退款时无法区分哪一部分该退给哪个组件。订单级促销的完整机制属于优惠券中心（本 hub 之外），本 hub 只约定它对组合行的接入口径：订单级让利按各行的 <code>allocated_amt</code> 比例继续向下分摊，这层分摊结果同样要在退货时按比例退还，具体见 <a href=\"../bundle-merchandising/bundle-return-component-recovery\">Bundle 退货按组件回收与退款分摊</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊的可核验性\">分摊的可核验性</h2><p>分摊表一旦落库，就必须能被独立核验——退款争议、税务稽查、成本复盘都会要求「这 249 是怎么分成三份的」。一条可核验的分摊至少要能重现三个数：组件的分摊基准、分摊比例、以及归属到该组件的尾差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分摊核验查询：任何一行都能重现金额的构成&#10;SELECT component_sku,&#10;       ref_price,&#10;       ROUND(ref_price / SUM(ref_price) OVER (), 6) AS ratio,&#10;       allocated_amt,&#10;       allocated_amt - ROUND(:paid * ref_price / SUM(ref_price) OVER (), 2) AS tail_diff&#10;FROM order_line_allocation&#10;WHERE order_id = :oid AND line_id = :lid&#10;ORDER BY ref_price DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分摊核验查询：任何一行都能重现金额的构成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> component_sku,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ref_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ref_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ref_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       allocated_amt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       allocated_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(:paid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ref_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail_diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_line_allocation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :lid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tail_diff</code> 一列是核验的关键：它应当只在前 R 个（R 为尾差的最小货币单位数）组件上非零，且绝对值不超过 1 个最小货币单位。若出现大额非零值，说明分摊实现有误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分摊是退款基数与成本核算的底稿，必须在订单落库时固化。</li>\n<li>相对独立售价是与收入确认合规口径一致的首选；等额分摊在组件价值差距大时会被反薅。</li>\n<li>尾差需显式指定归属，推荐按基准降序逐分发放。</li>\n<li>部分退货后是否重算是取舍：不重算简单但背离折扣率，重算一致但需处理不可能状态。</li>\n<li>累计退款不得超过实付金额，这条不变量应硬性强制。</li>\n<li>组合让利与订单级促销是两笔账，先组合后订单级，顺序不可颠倒。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分摊口径确定后，剩下的问题是组合要服务什么目标，见 <a href=\"bundle-margin-clearance-goal\">Bundle 毛利与清库存/搭售目标</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Bundle 价格与折扣在组件上的分摊","id":"bundle-价格与折扣在组件上的分摊"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么等额分摊会出事","id":"为什么等额分摊会出事"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊的落地结构","id":"分摊的落地结构"},{"level":3,"text":"尾差必须显式处理","id":"尾差必须显式处理"},{"level":2,"text":"二次分摊：部分退货后如何重算","id":"二次分摊-部分退货后如何重算"},{"level":3,"text":"退货基数的边界","id":"退货基数的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"与订单级促销的边界","id":"与订单级促销的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊的可核验性","id":"分摊的可核验性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"组件可售性、缺货与替代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/component-availability-substitute"},"next":{"title":"Bundle 毛利与清库存、搭售目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-margin-clearance-goal"}}